    "title": "Say what I plan or prepare to do",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-plans-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Say what I plan or prepare to do",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "打算 names a plan; 准备 can describe getting ready. 想 expresses a wish and does not itself promise a plan.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我打算去学校。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ dǎsuàn qù xuéxiào 。",
                "meaning": "I plan to go to school.",
                "audio": "b0dade8d5dd8063992b3148727b3e4335730788159e8dc3a5b859963c5a19f10"
              },
              {
                "text": "我在准备晚饭。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ zài zhǔnbèi wǎnfàn 。",
                "meaning": "I am preparing dinner.",
                "audio": "12d59769c0b7b5788409c166215ca8c3d00375ac31b7b006a62fc17ddc19eee9"
              },
              {
                "text": "我想买书。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ xiǎng mǎi shū 。",
                "meaning": "I would like to buy a book.",
                "audio": "89d480e2bca502b3dec8d53d75b5d1fa9fd01dc4947385ff5dc9e1773b163812"
              }
            ]
